class as EV-04-002, on an artifact the batch touched), the deliberately-out-of-scope DD-5 observation, and closeout bookkeeping — recording the EV-04-001 ratification ruling and the M3/M4 quality-half transfer in the impl log, and committing the working tree (fix-batch doc amendments plus the sanctioned PRD/tech-arch search-deferral backfill, both still uncommitted). None of these prevent safe closeout.\",\"recommendedNextStep\":\"Proceed to epic closeout: (1) sweep the one stale line in tech-design.md's Flow 2 diagram ('bandTokens: Σ stored' → measured per DD-4); (2) record in team-impl-log.md the EV-04-001 ratification ruling (per fix-batch-001), the fix-batch disposition including the invalid 001-fix-result.json envelope (edits verified landed despite the transport failure), and the M3/M4 quality-half transfer to the inference epic per epic.md Assumptions; (3) commit the working-tree changes — fix-batch doc amendments, comment-only code edits, and the sanctioned PRD AC-4.3 search-deferral backfill in 00-prd.md/01-tech-arch.md — as the epic closeout commit, with the final verify-all PASS (366/366, process suite ran) cited in the closeout record.\"},\"errors\":[],\"warnings\":[],\"artifacts\":[{\"kind\":\"result-envelope\",\"path\":\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/04-inspection/artifacts/epic/002-epic-reverify.json\"}],\"startedAt\":\"2026-06-12T16:03:47.064Z\",\"finishedAt\":\"2026-06-12T16:07:50.516Z\"}\n./packages/lhc/test/red-manifest.json:4:    \"test/smoke.test.ts\": \"5d737c488c61457eafa6c672a39e51502da72f9c05ad92339bede702a1da35ec\",\n./docs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/02-derivation-pipeline/team-impl-log.md:31:- Story gate: `pnpm run green-verify` — source: explicit CLI flag to preflight; rationale: every story file's §Verification names green-verify as the story gate; the test-immutability guard is compatible because red-manifest regeneration is a sanctioned story step (Story 0 and Story 2 amendments, test-plan §Sanct